    "text": "For a limited time only, Elite Craft Renovations is offering complete bathroom remodels at just nine thousand, nine hundred ninety-five dollars.",
    "after": 0.3
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "text": "That's right. A brand-new bathroom, fully remodeled, for under ten thousand dollars.",
    "after": 0.3
   },
   {
    "id": "b3",
    "text": "Most companies charge two to three times that amount, but we're making it affordable without sacrificing quality.",
    "after": 0.25
   },
   {
    "id": "b4",
    "text": "Our crews show up on time, protect your home, and deliver flawless results that not only look amazing, but last for years to come.",
    "after": 0.25
   },
   {
    "id": "b5",
    "text": "No mess. No delays. No hidden costs.",
    "after": 0.3
   },
   {
    "id": "b6",
    "text": "This isn't just about a new bathroom. It's about peace of mind, knowing you chose a trusted local Long Island company with years of experience and a reputation for doing things right.",
    "after": 0.3
   },
   {
    "id": "cta",
    "text": "Spots for this offer are extremely limited. Click Get Quote below to schedule your free estimate and inspection.",
    "after": 0.1
   }
  ]
 },
